      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Circle marker opening the entry for Funai domain, in Bungo province (present-day Ōita city). Nothing at all is printed to its right on this leaf, so every column to its left belongs to Funai. The page prints the circle, then 府, then a blank type slot, then 内 — no 藩 glyph."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "○府内藩"
